OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cold, clear start with frost
OL,6,Fin places. Then remaining dry and
OL,7,Fsettled through the day with plenty of
OL,8,Fsunshine but some patchy cloud
OL,9,Fdeveloping for the afternoon. Light
OL,10,Fwinds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FDry and settled overnight
OL,13,Fwith light winds and lengthy clear
OL,14,Fspells. Turning cold again, with a
OL,15,Ffrost developing across many areas by
OL,16,Fmorning.
OL,17,
OL,18,CSunday:FAnother cold start with a risk
OL,19,Fof frost in places. Remaining dry and
OL,20,Fsettled during the day with lengthy
OL,21,Fsunshine and light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
